        "text": "You can now treat a pipe system like a signed rate equation.\n\nInlet → add.\nOutlet → subtract.\nPositive total → tank fills.\nNegative total → tank empties.\n\nNever add or subtract the times themselves. Convert each time to a rate first.\n\nNext, we use this same idea to uncover hidden leaks and waste pipes.",
